Any time one of your skeleton or bone giant dies, it shatters in radius [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)], making any foe bleed for [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical damage over 5 turns.

If any other skeleton or bone giant minion is in the radius it will pickup some of the bones to enhance itself, increasing maximum and current life by [30, 63, 89, 110, 130 (TL1-5)], armour by [6, 9, 11, 13, 15 (TL1-5)] and gain [3.00, 19, 31, 41, 50 (TL1-5)] physical melee retaliation for 20 turns.

This talent never works when you kill your own minions.
